# Generated output files (pipeline artefacts). Hand-maintained INPUTS and the
# committed OSM harvest snapshot (the tier-3 gazetteer) are un-ignored so a
# fresh clone reproduces enrichment and endpoint resolution. (constants/* not
# constants/ — git cannot re-include files under an excluded directory.)
constants/*
!constants/london_boroughs.geojson
!constants/yellow_badge_sectors.json
!constants/osm_pois.json
output/
*.geojson
!constants/london_boroughs.geojson
!blue_book_demo/poi_overrides.json
!blue_book_demo/run_specific_fixes.json

# Cached graph + derived indexes (kept in /tmp by default, ignored here too
# in case someone sets cache_dir to the project root).
app_cache/
*.graphml
# ...except the hand-built test fixtures. These are small (~23 KB), synthetic,
# and required for the end-to-end test to run at all — without them a fresh
# clone can't load the fixture and the whole test class errors out.
!tests/fixtures/*.graphml
alias_index.pkl
street_index.pkl
turn_restrictions.json

# QA artefacts
qa_report.json
